    "The vehicles CitySample's Mass traffic drives, and which rig each one carries.",
    "CitySample has two Blueprints per model: BP_<model> is the low-detail, non-physics stand-in Mass",
    "uses far from the viewer, and BP_<model>_Sandbox is the physics car it swaps in near it. Sensors go",
    "on the physics car, so `class` is the Sandbox one. `category` picks the rig through",
    "`rigs_by_category` unless the vehicle names its own `rig`. `weight` biases --vehicle random.",
    "Only these vehicles are ever adopted as the ego. The bus is left out on purpose: it isn't a",
    "useful ego for an AV dataset. Buses in traffic are still labeled and boxed as 'bus'."
